# Rust: rustc, cargo, clippy, rustdoc, rustfmt, rust-analyzer and the
# standard library's sources (rust-src), from the source release, which
# has its crates vendored. rustc links the sdk's LLVM (llvm-config,
# shared) and runs the sdk's gcc as its linker. Built by Rust (stage0):
# the toolchain reference's, or Fedora's (rust-host) without one. cargo
# links pos' libcurl and OpenSSL (HTTP, registries, git over https).
build-requires rust pos-link llvm python3
requires glibc gcc-runtime gcc llvm openssl curl zlib
provides cargo
obsoletes rust-host
archive https://static.rust-lang.org/dist/rustc-1.99.1-src.tar.xz 6451598a99e77f07571960f6b21d577399d3a30f33e80cbd2e3a4aae6535d265
version 1.99.1
